# Interview topic content

Topic folders under `interview/` with files wired in `interview/Config/topics.json`:

- `comprehensive`, `questions`, `quickRef`, `critical`, `mindMap` (paths relative to `interview/`)

## Editing

- Keep interview Q&A answerable out loud; prefer concrete controls over slogans
- Human prose; no AI watermark patterns
- After Config path edits: `python3 interview/Scripts/check_topics_contract.py`
- Mind maps / search index: see Scripts in `AGENTS.md`; do not hand-edit generated JSON unless you know the builder
